              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At’ Uzobona ibara, Korazini; uzobona ibara, Betsayida; kukw ibikomeye vyakorewe muri mwebge iyo biba vyarakorewe muri Tiro n’i Sidoni, baba barihannye kera, bakambara amagunira, bakīsīga iminyota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
